name yquant
category Package
revision 63255
shortdesc Typesetting quantum circuits in a human-readable language
longdesc This LaTeX package allows to quickly draw quantum circuits. It
longdesc bridges the gap between the two groups of packages that already
longdesc exist: those that use a logic-oriented custom language, which
longdesc is then translated into TeX by means of an external program;
longdesc and the pure TeX versions that mainly provide some macros to
longdesc allow for an easier input. yquant is a pure-LaTeX solution --
longdesc i.e., it requires no external program -- that introduces a
longdesc logic oriented language and thus brings the best of both worlds
longdesc together. It builds on and interacts with TikZ, which brings an
longdesc enourmous flexibility for customization of individual circuit.
